  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A little diversion goes a long way.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Feint Partner<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Enemies made flat-footed by Feint Partner remain flat-footed against you until the end of your next turn. During this time, you can make a feint against that creature as a swift action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-teamwork-feats#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
